//! Constant tables, transcribed from Speex 1.2beta1.
//!
//! Generated by `tools/gentables.py` from `loqrs/speexb1/libspeex/`;
//! do not hand-edit. Every table is the **`FIXED_POINT` arm** -- `h0`,
//! `h1` and the gain tables each have a float twin under the same name,
//! and picking the wrong one is silent.
//!
//! Loquendo replaces the *codebooks* (LSP and innovation) per voice, but
//! not these: the gain ladders, the pitch gain codebook and the QMF
//! filters are stock, which is why the rebuilt shim decodes bit-exact
//! using them unchanged.

